<p>Hi <%= firstName %>,</p>

<p>
  The <%= appTitle %> has received a request to reset your password.
</p>

<p>
  <a
    href="<%= passwordResetUrl %>"
    target="_blank"
    >Please verify your password reset request by clicking on me!</a
  >
</p>

<p>
  If clicking on the link is not working, you can copy and paste the link
  below:<br />
  <%= passwordResetUrl %>
</p>

<p></p><strong>Didn't request this change?</strong><br/>
If you have not requested to reset your password, do not click or visit the link.</p>

<p><em>This is an automated email, and replies will not get received.</em></p>
